# Frontend

- App Router (`apps/web/src/app`).
- Server Components by default; Client Components only for state/interaction.
- API calls via helpers in `apps/web/src/lib`.
- UI: Tailwind; reusable components under `apps/web/src/components`.
- Reuse prototype HTML/Tailwind from TravelOS-AI-Ecosystem (see `ui-prototype-reuse` rule).
- No secrets on the client except `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
- Accessibility: labels, contrast, visible focus (UX leads).
